Subject: [PATCH] Monitor hidden D3D11 devices and return from fallback WARP

Check native removal independently of painting, including hidden windows.
Re-enumerate stale DXGI factories and compare adapter identity and driver
version before requesting recovery. Respect explicit software and adapter
selection. Probe a hardware replacement with capped cadence, retain it for
recovery, and keep the working software device until that probe succeeds.

